  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c2406f93db80d947b0f2e4a7a4da510, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OrbitToss.Runtime::OrbitToss.VRMenuController
  menuCanvasRoot: {fileID: 1783036332}
  mainMenuPanel: {fileID: 1903963139}
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 707373585}
  settingsPanel: {fileID: 618022312}
  hudPanel: {fileID: 250788458}
  game: {fileID: 150621696}
  settings: {fileID: 1589447003}
  audioManager: {fileID: 1431352095}
  tutorialBody: {fileID: 1761433518}
  tutorialPageLabel: {fileID: 342792495}
  tutorialPages:
  - 'WELCOME TO ORBIT TOSS


    Boccia is a precision ball sport. Throw your planet
    balls as close as possible to the small WHITE ball, called the Jack.


    You
    can play seated. You never need to walk.'
  - '1. GRAB


    Reach for a planet ball on the tray beside you. Hold the GRIP
    button (middle finger) on your controller to pick it up.'
  - '2. AIM AND THROW


    Face the white Jack. Swing your arm gently towards it
    and let go of the GRIP button to release.


    A soft, smooth swing works best.
    A very gentle drop returns the ball to the tray.'
  - '3. SCORE


    When the ball stops, you see its distance to the Jack. The closest
    ball is marked CLOSEST.


    Feedback: [***] Perfect, [**] Good Throw, [*] Close,
    [~] Try Again.'
  - '4. MENUS


    Point your controller at a button and pull the TRIGGER (index
    finger) to press it.


    Use RESET for a new round and MENU to return here.
    Settings change colours, volume, vibration and the tray height.'
  themeValue: {fileID: 1644757248}
  masterValue: {fileID: 1301186178}
  musicValue: {fileID: 1778633584}
  sfxValue: {fileID: 117864411}
  musicToggleValue: {fileID: 437867923}
  hapticsValue: {fileID: 207780024}
  rackHeightValue: {fileID: 1313034496}
  rackSideValue: {fileID: 901012575}
